{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"Mason McElroy\n        Game Designer · Mathematician\n      \n      \n        \n          4:3\n        \n        \n          \n            SLOT\n            CLUSTER PAYS\n          \n          Lucky Pharaoh's 3×3\n          Cluster pays on 9 individual reels. Infinite hold & spin.\n        \n      \n    \n    \n      B — Slate + Cyan (Recommended)\n      Dark blue-slate with electric cyan accent. Clean geometric sans (Inter or DM Sans), tight and precise. Feels like a game engine inspector or a well-designed dashboard tool. Technical but polished — the kind of thing a senior engineer's portfolio looks like.","choice":"slate-cyan","id":null,"timestamp":1781541133765}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"PROTOTYPE PORTFOLIO\n        Mason McElroy\n      \n      \n        \n          4:3\n        \n        \n          Slot · Cluster Pays\n          Lucky Pharaoh's 3×3\n          Cluster pays on 9 reels. Hold & spin.\n          PLAY GAME →\n        \n      \n    \n    \n      C — Charcoal + Pure White\n      Maximum restraint. Near-black with white as the only contrast — no color accent at all. Precision through subtraction. Shows confidence in the work itself rather than the design. Risk: can feel cold or unfinished if the thumbnails don't pop.","choice":"charcoal-white","id":null,"timestamp":1781541155079}
